# Files in THIS REPO FOLDER that must not be pushed by a raw `clasp push`.
#
# NOTICE 2026-09-18 (Gary): Credentials.js is deliberately NOT listed here.
# `clasp push` REPLACES the project's remote file set, so an ignored/absent accessor
# gets DELETED live (2026-08-21: this project's accessor had to be restored by hand).
# The SECRET-FREE Credentials.js is tracked in git and pushed; secrets live in
# Script Properties.
#
# `Code.js` is a defensive entry (this project has no Code.js), manifest.json is
# repo-tooling metadata.
manifest.json
Code.js
